# Production Backend API Endpoint
# In local development: leave empty to use the Vite proxy (/api)
# In production (e.g. Vercel/Netlify): set to your deployed backend URL:
# Example: https://nexkart-api.onrender.com/api or https://api.nexkart.com/api
VITE_API_URL=
